# Nix build outputs
result
result-*

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.claude

# Secrets — seeded locally, never tracked
config/.config/rsync/dxp_pass

# Caelestia CLI output: ~/.config/hypr is a recursive out-of-store symlink
# into this tree, so the CLI's apply_colours writes
# ~/.config/hypr/scheme/current.{conf,lua} here. WF-12 severs the CLI regen
# path so this is never regenerated by the shell, but leave it ignored so a
# manual `caelestia wallpaper`/`scheme set` never shows up as a tracked
# change. The warm-metal Hyprland colors are set directly in
# config/.config/hypr/looknfeel.lua (literal rgba), not via these variables.
config/.config/hypr/scheme/
